  "html": "<h1>Newline Collapse</h1>\n<p>This paragraph is soft-wrapped across several source lines that Confluence would otherwise render as hard breaks, so they collapse to spaces.</p>\n<pre><code>code lines\nkeep their\nnewlines\n</code></pre>\n<p>A final soft-wrapped paragraph.</p>\n",
